        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Jawaharlal Nehru</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1889 CE – 1964 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">14 November 1889, in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prayagraj">Allahabad</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-india">British India</a>; first child of the barrister and Congress leader Motilal Nehru and Swarup Rani, of the Kashmiri Pandit community</span></div>
